## Design notes worth knowing 🔍
- The console deliberately does NOT use ArenaState to read the arena DB —
  ArenaState's constructor runs migrations (writes). A viewer opening a
  ledger writable would be a bug waiting to happen; SQLite's `mode=ro`
  enforces the invariant at the connection level (test-pinned).
- The crimson-dashed drawdown reference from the oil app renders as a plain
  running-peak series for now — `st.line_chart` can't dash; the plotly
  upgrade is noted in-code as deliberately out of scope.
- Streamlit was installed into your venv via the pre-approved
  `dashboard` extra (`uv sync --extra dashboard`) — plain `uv sync` still
  excludes it.

